# VIP reserV — design notes

Resume: `@vip$` / `$vip-tables$` / `$vip-reserv$`. Status: **BUILDING — Phase 2 booking MVP (owner go-ahead Oct 16 2026).** Product brand: **VIP reserV** (protected / never-translate). Feature key `vipReservations` (`IsFeatureEnabled=0`, `IsTestFeature=1` until Master Admin seeds/enables). Surfaces: `vip.html`, `vip-door.html`, portal Reservations, Search tile `vipReservBtnCard`, FloqAi intent `vip-reserv`, plans in `vip-plans/`. Full proposal: `reports/vip-reservations-proposal.md`. Owner sheet: `reports/vip-owner-decision-sheet.md`. Translation: `vip-reservations-translation-incomplete.mdc` (does **not** block Live per VIP-P-15 C).

**Phase 2 shipped (this iteration):** inventory holds (30 min), Terms consent, FloqR Stripe deposit checkout (`orderType: vipReservation`), My Profile Reservations + pass, `vip-door.html` check-in/no-show, VIP-B-24 receipt SMS + invoice redactor. **Still later:** Club Admin VIP tab, promoter path, Aurelia 2D, counsel Live Terms, Model B invoicing. Sheet IDs: **0 OPEN**. Counsel-adjacent still open: self-billing · stale check · 1099/W-9.

## Help mirror (always — every owner decision)

**Standing requirement:** whatever decisions are made for VIP reserV, help must be adequately documented. Every owner decision that creates or changes a user-facing surface must ship with a FloqAi / help mirror (`floqai-help-repository.js` + `floqr-i18n-help.js` when translated) **before that surface goes Live**. Beta English-only help is OK while `vip-reservations-translation-incomplete.mdc` is open. Decision sheet rows carry concrete help ids (e.g. `help-vip-deposit-settings`, `help-vip-reserv-brand`).

